---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

import ContactCTA from '../../components/ContactCTA.astro';
import Hero from '../../components/Hero.astro';
import Icon from '../../components/Icon.astro';

const slidesUrl = 'https://talks.gongfu.dev/10-min/';
const sourceUrl = 'https://github.com/gongfudev/talks/tree/gh-pages/10-min';
---

<BaseLayout
	title="Gōng-fu I/O en 10 min. | Talks | Gōng-fu DEV"
	description="Ten-minute presentation of the Gōng-fu I/O hack sessions, given at the Geneva JUG on 27 May 2014"
>
	<div class="stack gap-20">
		<div class="stack gap-15">
			<header>
				<div class="wrapper stack gap-2">
					<a class="back-link" href="/talks/"><Icon icon="arrow-left" /> Talks</a>
					<Hero title="Gōng-fu I/O en 10 min." align="start">
						<div class="details">
							<p class="description">
								A ten-minute presentation of our hack sessions — studying and exploring together:
								why, for whom, and how it works in practice.
							</p>
							<a class="slides-link" href={slidesUrl}>View the slides</a>
						</div>
					</Hero>
				</div>
			</header>
			<main class="wrapper">
				<div class="stack gap-10 content">
					<a href={slidesUrl}>
						<img
							width="1440"
							height="888"
							src="/assets/talks/gongfu-io-en-10-min.jpg"
							alt="Participants of a Gōng-fu I/O session working around a table"
						/>
					</a>
					<div class="content">
						<dl>
							<dt>Event</dt>
							<dd>Geneva JUG, 27 May 2014</dd>
							<dt>Speakers</dt>
							<dd>David Hodgetts and Olivier Lange, with Andreas Kündig</dd>
							<dt>Language</dt>
							<dd>French</dd>
						</dl>
						<p>
							The talk walks through what a Gōng-fu session is (and isn't): a simple and very old
							idea, a time set aside to go back to the sources and study them for oneself, to study
							and explore together — in pairs or solo, on a regular basis, sharing what was learned.
							It closes on who the sessions are for, why we run them, and what the name Gōng-fu
							means.
						</p>
						<p>
							The <a href={slidesUrl}>slides</a> were built with
							<a href="https://github.com/impress/impress.js">impress.js</a>; they are best viewed
							full-screen on a desktop browser. Their <a href={sourceUrl}>source</a> is available on
							GitHub under a
							<a href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/">CC BY-SA 4.0</a> license.
						</p>
						<p>
							Note: the group was named Gōng-fu I/O until 2023, when it was renamed Gōng-fu DEV;
							the slides still use the former name.
						</p>
					</div>
				</div>
			</main>
		</div>
		<ContactCTA />
	</div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
	header {
		padding-bottom: 2.5rem;
		border-bottom: 1px solid var(--gray-800);
	}

	.back-link {
		display: none;
	}

	.details {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		padding: 0.5rem;
		gap: 1.5rem;
		justify-content: space-between;
		align-items: center;
	}

	.description {
		font-size: var(--text-lg);
		max-width: 54ch;
	}

	.slides-link {
		flex-shrink: 0;
		padding: 0.5rem 1.25rem;
		border-radius: 999rem;
		color: var(--accent-text-over);
		background-color: var(--accent-regular);
		font-family: var(--font-brand);
		font-weight: 500;
		text-decoration: none;
		box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
	}

	.slides-link:hover,
	.slides-link:focus {
		box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
	}

	.content {
		max-width: 65ch;
		margin-inline: auto;
	}

	.content > :global(* + *) {
		margin-top: 1rem;
	}

	.content img {
		border-radius: 1.5rem;
		box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
		background: var(--gradient-subtle);
		border: 1px solid var(--gray-800);
	}

	dl {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: auto 1fr;
		gap: 0.25rem 1.5rem;
	}

	dt {
		color: var(--gray-0);
		font-weight: 600;
	}

	dd {
		margin: 0;
	}

	.back-link,
	.content a {
		text-decoration: 1px solid underline transparent;
		text-underline-offset: 0.25em;
		transition: text-decoration-color var(--theme-transition);
	}

	.back-link:hover,
	.back-link:focus,
	.content a:hover,
	.content a:focus {
		text-decoration-color: currentColor;
	}

	@media (min-width: 50em) {
		.back-link {
			display: block;
			align-self: flex-start;
		}

		.details {
			flex-direction: row;
			gap: 2.5rem;
		}
	}
</style>
